{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"Muhammad Jauhar Vikri","identifier":"doi:10.64479/iarci.v1i2.61","title":"Impact of Data Normalization on K-Nearest Neighbor Classification Performance: A Case Study on Date Fruit Dataset","year":2026},"claim":"Z-score standardization leads to higher and more consistent classification accuracy compared to other normalization methods in KNN.","concepts":["feature scaling","standardization","nearest neighbor","accuracy"],"id":"E1","quote":"Z-score standardization achieves the highest and most stable accuracy, followed by Min–Max normalization.","stance":"supports"},"hash":"2fee50522ff305cde9a1310f853277d3834b3d35f1b5f3d69c8a05149628c015","kind":"artefact","prev":"54655e030bd6f38e5a3e2bf09e11dcbeebecbdde08eac55f55624ecd5b7a049c","seq":12,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.012+00:00"}
{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"Jonson Manurung","identifier":"doi:10.35335/mandiri.v14i2.466","title":"Optimizing the performance of the K-Nearest Neighbors algorithm using grid search and feature scaling to improve data classification accuracy","year":2025},"claim":"Applying feature scaling in combination with parameter optimization significantly improves KNN accuracy.","concepts":["feature scaling","standardization","nearest neighbor","accuracy"],"id":"E2","quote":"The optimized KNN configuration with k = 9, weights = distance, and metric = manhattan achieved an average accuracy of 97.19%, outperforming the baseline accuracy of 93.86%.","stance":"supports"},"hash":"d4ad58f96e4b6ff5a35b98fcb35d6d298097d2c449d8df358147c56ebebbaf1c","kind":"artefact","prev":"2fee50522ff305cde9a1310f853277d3834b3d35f1b5f3d69c8a05149628c015","seq":13,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.012+00:00"}
{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"Dadi Rahmat","identifier":"doi:10.1109/iceei52609.2021.9611110","title":"Heart Disease Prediction Using K-Nearest Neighbor","year":2021},"claim":"This study uses standardization of the dataset as part of its approach to improve the performance of KNN-based heart disease prediction.","concepts":["feature scaling","standardization","nearest neighbor","accuracy"],"id":"E3","quote":"The aim of this study is to improve the performance of heart disease prediction using standardization dataset and feature selection for KNN.","stance":"supports"},"hash":"a987aa221375e7d1a9b4b7163a6bccbb45f5fcbe1d503284bf57d74dec67b39e","kind":"artefact","prev":"d4ad58f96e4b6ff5a35b98fcb35d6d298097d2c449d8df358147c56ebebbaf1c","seq":14,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.012+00:00"}
{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"S. Basak","identifier":"doi:10.1109/smc42975.2020.9282834","title":"Evolutionary Feature Scaling in K-Nearest Neighbors Based on Label Dispersion Minimization","year":2020},"claim":"Feature weighting, informed by dataset dispersion measures, improves the accuracy of KNN classification and regression, suggesting that feature scaling or weighting related to scaling can enhance performance.","concepts":["feature scaling","standardization","nearest neighbor","accuracy"],"id":"E4","quote":"It is empirically demonstrated that these measures of dispersion can be indicative of the performance of KNN regression and classification. This idea is further used to learn feature weights that help improve the accuracy of KNN classification and regression.","stance":"supports"},"hash":"9dc3f385c6079ee3561863d4cd60a508bc7ce400fdc91413fec266d62ac95a1c","kind":"artefact","prev":"a987aa221375e7d1a9b4b7163a6bccbb45f5fcbe1d503284bf57d74dec67b39e","seq":15,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.012+00:00"}
{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"Dong Li","identifier":"doi:10.1109/glocom.2014.7036847","title":"A feature scaling based k-nearest neighbor algorithm for indoor positioning system","year":2014},"claim":"The paper proposes a feature scaling method that modifies the distance calculation in k-nearest neighbor classification by introducing signal-level-scaled weights, improving localization accuracy.","concepts":["feature scaling","nearest neighbor","distance","accuracy"],"id":"E5","quote":"In FS-kNN, we build a novel RSS-based feature scaling model, which introduces signal-level-scaled weights in the calculation of effective signal distance between signal vector reported by mobile device and existing fingerprints.","stance":"supports"},"hash":"cdf89f8f577f1e2147de709908c512733089e08db335f2cc717acb4a2cc024f9","kind":"artefact","prev":"9dc3f385c6079ee3561863d4cd60a508bc7ce400fdc91413fec266d62ac95a1c","seq":16,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.012+00:00"}
{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"Muasir Pagan","identifier":"doi:10.1109/assp54407.2021.00044","title":"Investigating the impact of data scaling on the k-nearest neighbor algorithm","year":2023},"claim":"Data scaling has a significant impact on KNN algorithm performance, indicating that standardization or similar scaling can influence accuracy and other performance metrics.","concepts":["feature scaling","standardization","nearest neighbor","accuracy"],"id":"E6","quote":"The results show that data scaling significantly affects the performance of the KNN algorithm, and the choice of scaling method can have significant implications for practical applications.","stance":"supports"},"hash":"2a0322393ebd9a992536604a5b1fb1b9fb1b611d4804b9b9a7c228d8efea6ee8","kind":"artefact","prev":"cdf89f8f577f1e2147de709908c512733089e08db335f2cc717acb4a2cc024f9","seq":17,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.012+00:00"}
{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"K. Parveen","identifier":"doi:10.52783/jes.7419","title":"Enhanced Credit Scoring Prediction Using KNN-Z-Score Based Logistic Regression (KZ-LR) Algorithm","year":2024},"claim":"Z-score standardization is used as part of the preprocessing phase to ensure data uniformity, which is essential for consistent modeling.","concepts":["feature scaling","standardization","nearest neighbor","accuracy"],"id":"E7","quote":"The preprocessing phase incorporates advanced techniques like KNN imputation, Z-score standardization, and min-max normalization to ensure data integrity and uniformity.","stance":"supports"},"hash":"a56e45db17e016c027f01e127df1c4c0c3e07d45822fb1abe232a175a5923410","kind":"artefact","prev":"2a0322393ebd9a992536604a5b1fb1b9fb1b611d4804b9b9a7c228d8efea6ee8","seq":18,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.013+00:00"}
{"actor":"literature","data":{"citation":{"first_author":"J.K. Kanimozhi","identifier":"doi:10.1109/icctdc64446.2025.11158881","title":"Comparing SVM and KNN Algorithm for High Accuracy in Brain Tumor Prediction","year":2025},"claim":"Feature scaling is applied in the SVM algorithm's implementation, which involves distance measures, suggesting that feature scaling is used to improve classification performance in a k-nearest-neighbor-like context.","concepts":["feature scaling","standardization","nearest neighbor","accuracy"],"id":"E8","quote":"Group 2 using the SVM algorithm with distance measures and feature scaling.","stance":"context"},"hash":"b62bee3610b0de14d6da5d655025c7bab3b7e4149b0345cfec0018b4525d1e6a","kind":"artefact","prev":"a56e45db17e016c027f01e127df1c4c0c3e07d45822fb1abe232a175a5923410","seq":19,"stage":"evidence","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:59.013+00:00"}
